<h1>independent set</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A set of <a href="vertex.html"><em>vertices</em></a> in a <a href="graph.html"><em>graph</em></a> such that for any pair of vertices, there is no <a href="edge.html"><em>edge</em></a> between them.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="maximalIndependentSet.html"><em>maximal independent set</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorSKS">SKS</a></p>
<h2>Implementation</h2>
<a href="https://algorist.com/problems/Independent_Set.html" target="_blank">(Fortran and C)</a>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
Structures</a> home page.

